diff --git a/src/ServerScriptService/Modules/Systems/Gameplay/BlockPlacementSystem/Implementation/_BlockPlacementNotificationMediator.luau b/src/ServerScriptService/Modules/Systems/Gameplay/BlockPlacementSystem/Implementation/_BlockPlacementNotificationMediator.luau
